                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ad57982f-8a4c-34e7-b5b9-745f4b0b3aa0",
                                        "entry_id": "9fafc42c-3740-3bd2-833a-14639ba82695",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Somewhere one can find protection.",
                                            "A place where a person or animal may find protection from the elements (especially rain, storms, or cold) sometimes as a place to sleep (such as a cave)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7253004e-f209-4613-bbe1-115a85e5dc8b",
                                                "sense_id": "ad57982f-8a4c-34e7-b5b9-745f4b0b3aa0",
                                                "text": "The band of explorers found a shelter behind the waterfall, which they rested at for three days."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "44d99929-b862-4675-b050-219a85c6706e",
                                                "sense_id": "ad57982f-8a4c-34e7-b5b9-745f4b0b3aa0",
                                                "text": "rock shelter"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e3fa65fb-ce98-367c-82e1-cfcb7fce4b8c",
                                        "entry_id": "9fafc42c-3740-3bd2-833a-14639ba82695",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Somewhere one can find protection.",
                                            "A bare-bones above-ground structure meant to provide temporary cover from the elements; usually small and with no door to close."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "usually"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "95068d9e-7bbc-410a-9f8c-1a8b3edfd9e6",
                                                "sense_id": "e3fa65fb-ce98-367c-82e1-cfcb7fce4b8c",
                                                "text": "The detective kept them in view. He made his way casually along the inside of the shelter until he reached an open scuttle close to where the two men were standing talking. Eavesdropping was not a thing Larard would have practised from choice, but there were times when, in the public interest, he had to do it, and this was one of them."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f7fc90bd-c475-46cc-8fb6-bd7f2888a811",
                                                "sense_id": "e3fa65fb-ce98-367c-82e1-cfcb7fce4b8c",
                                                "text": "bus shelter"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7366ff2-af6b-4a84-bdd2-b8f39353beb9",
                                                "sense_id": "e3fa65fb-ce98-367c-82e1-cfcb7fce4b8c",
                                                "text": "waiting shelter"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "594a2550-7a3b-3885-a307-c5a3ab58d02f",
                                        "entry_id": "9fafc42c-3740-3bd2-833a-14639ba82695",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Somewhere one can find protection.",
                                            "A place for protection from deadly conditions outside, including military assault; usually partly or fully underground."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
